{
  "kind": "Exact untimed original-sentence/native-image mapping",
  "lesson_id": "app-unit-call-lifecycle-native",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "scene_id": "01",
      "sentence_id": "01-01",
      "text": "The Unit app keeps a vehicle or operational team in view while you work its calls.",
      "capture_id": "017-fresh-original-calls-baseline",
      "image_sha256": "2265353a815ae24d9d4a93513dfee93e342462e70d751f4027e505bf0d96e697",
      "required_labels": [
        "Calls",
        "Ambulance 61"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "01",
      "sentence_id": "01-02",
      "text": "Here, the Calls screen shows Ambulance Sixty-one and No Active Call.",
      "capture_id": "017-fresh-original-calls-baseline",
      "image_sha256": "2265353a815ae24d9d4a93513dfee93e342462e70d751f4027e505bf0d96e697",
      "required_labels": [
        "Calls",
        "No Active Call"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "01",
      "sentence_id": "01-03",
      "text": "The roles card reads zero of one, so this recording does not establish a staffed crew.",
      "capture_id": "017-fresh-original-calls-baseline",
      "image_sha256": "2265353a815ae24d9d4a93513dfee93e342462e70d751f4027e505bf0d96e697",
      "required_labels": [
        "0 of 1 Roles"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "01",
      "sentence_id": "01-04",
      "text": "Use the circular plus button at the lower right to open a new call when your department permits you to create one.",
      "capture_id": "017-fresh-original-calls-baseline",
      "image_sha256": "2265353a815ae24d9d4a93513dfee93e342462e70d751f4027e505bf0d96e697",
      "required_labels": [],
      "native_control": "new-call-fab",
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "02",
      "sentence_id": "02-01",
      "text": "In New Call, enter a clear Name and a useful Nature description.",
      "capture_id": "047-v7-recent-top-field-verification",
      "image_sha256": "f57b0c7850a5c84f6adb5b47f4f5990051f1709586005ee966d6e41e336ea607",
      "required_labels": [
        "New Call"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "02",
      "sentence_id": "02-02",
      "text": "Our example is explicitly labeled training only and describes a software exercise.",
      "capture_id": "047-v7-recent-top-field-verification",
      "image_sha256": "f57b0c7850a5c84f6adb5b47f4f5990051f1709586005ee966d6e41e336ea607",
      "required_labels": [
        "Create New Call"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "02",
      "sentence_id": "02-03",
      "text": "Review Priority and Type; this practice call uses Routine and Investigation.",
      "capture_id": "047-v7-recent-top-field-verification",
      "image_sha256": "f57b0c7850a5c84f6adb5b47f4f5990051f1709586005ee966d6e41e336ea607",
      "required_labels": [
        "Routine",
        "Investigation"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "02",
      "sentence_id": "02-04",
      "text": "Use Note for additional context that belongs with the call.",
      "capture_id": "047-v7-recent-top-field-verification",
      "image_sha256": "f57b0c7850a5c84f6adb5b47f4f5990051f1709586005ee966d6e41e336ea607",
      "required_labels": [
        "Note"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "02",
      "sentence_id": "02-05",
      "text": "Choose names and classifications that make sense to your own operation rather than copying a firehouse example into live work.",
      "capture_id": "047-v7-recent-top-field-verification",
      "image_sha256": "f57b0c7850a5c84f6adb5b47f4f5990051f1709586005ee966d6e41e336ea607",
      "required_labels": [
        "Routine",
        "Investigation"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "03",
      "sentence_id": "03-01",
      "text": "Call Location provides Address, GPS Coordinates, what3words and Plus Code fields, along with Select Location on Map.",
      "capture_id": "048-v7-middle-empty-location-verification",
      "image_sha256": "a60de92f06a49023f052cf40510504bee9de84031c190f207f3479db2b0b41ef",
      "required_labels": [
        "Call Location",
        "Address",
        "GPS Coordinates",
        "what3words",
        "Plus Code",
        "Select Location on Map"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "03",
      "sentence_id": "03-02",
      "text": "Destination POI is a separate choice and currently reads No destination selected.",
      "capture_id": "048-v7-middle-empty-location-verification",
      "image_sha256": "a60de92f06a49023f052cf40510504bee9de84031c190f207f3479db2b0b41ef",
      "required_labels": [
        "Destination POI",
        "No destination selected"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "03",
      "sentence_id": "03-03",
      "text": "This software-only exercise leaves the location and contact inputs empty; a real assignment needs the location information required by your operating procedure.",
      "capture_id": "048-v7-middle-empty-location-verification",
      "image_sha256": "a60de92f06a49023f052cf40510504bee9de84031c190f207f3479db2b0b41ef",
      "required_labels": [
        "Call Location",
        "Contact Name",
        "Contact Info"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "03",
      "sentence_id": "03-04",
      "text": "A visible location field does not establish that a device has supplied GPS coordinates or that an address lookup has succeeded.",
      "capture_id": "048-v7-middle-empty-location-verification",
      "image_sha256": "a60de92f06a49023f052cf40510504bee9de84031c190f207f3479db2b0b41ef",
      "required_labels": [
        "GPS Coordinates",
        "Address"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "04",
      "sentence_id": "04-01",
      "text": "In Select Dispatch Recipients, review individual users as well as the broad Everyone option.",
      "capture_id": "044-v6-final-everyone-off-users-boden-two",
      "image_sha256": "9b6d7ec71eddc852c2b0240a84d7c2b6e10e963d2024f0e4942795c2b8075f01",
      "required_labels": [
        "Select Dispatch Recipients",
        "Everyone"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "04",
      "sentence_id": "04-02",
      "text": "Wallace Boden is checked here, while Everyone remains unchecked.",
      "capture_id": "044-v6-final-everyone-off-users-boden-two",
      "image_sha256": "9b6d7ec71eddc852c2b0240a84d7c2b6e10e963d2024f0e4942795c2b8075f01",
      "required_labels": [
        "Wallace Boden",
        "Everyone"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "04",
      "sentence_id": "04-03",
      "text": "In the Units section, Ambulance Sixty-one is also selected, bringing this exercise to two selected recipients.",
      "capture_id": "043-v6-unit-ambulance-selected-two",
      "image_sha256": "ae1374a1c9262dcf62c130fe886bd1a0031572d351d4455b49e4af49aa97b29d",
      "required_labels": [
        "Units (8)",
        "Ambulance 61",
        "2 selected"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "04",
      "sentence_id": "04-04",
      "text": "Confirm retains that reviewed audience; it does not demonstrate that a recipient has received a notification.",
      "capture_id": "043-v6-unit-ambulance-selected-two",
      "image_sha256": "ae1374a1c9262dcf62c130fe886bd1a0031572d351d4455b49e4af49aa97b29d",
      "required_labels": [
        "Confirm"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "05",
      "sentence_id": "05-01",
      "text": "Back on New Call, verify Dispatch To and its two selected recipients.",
      "capture_id": "049-v7-final-bottom-two-unscheduled",
      "image_sha256": "431232cb6173a99944aa93140fffee6eab78ebfce231d233ddbdc9f09ce03e86",
      "required_labels": [
        "New Call",
        "Dispatch To",
        "2 selected"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "05",
      "sentence_id": "05-02",
      "text": "Dispatch Time is blank in this exercise; no future schedule is entered.",
      "capture_id": "049-v7-final-bottom-two-unscheduled",
      "image_sha256": "431232cb6173a99944aa93140fffee6eab78ebfce231d233ddbdc9f09ce03e86",
      "required_labels": [
        "Dispatch Time"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "05",
      "sentence_id": "05-03",
      "text": "After reviewing the form, use Create once.",
      "capture_id": "049-v7-final-bottom-two-unscheduled",
      "image_sha256": "431232cb6173a99944aa93140fffee6eab78ebfce231d233ddbdc9f09ce03e86",
      "required_labels": [
        "Create"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "05",
      "sentence_id": "05-04",
      "text": "The Calls list now contains the new training exercise with Boden and Ambulance Sixty-one shown on its card.",
      "capture_id": "051-settled-created-training-call-list",
      "image_sha256": "f012fd7a3f3539dedeaae4ecc2dd8875a0d3f49d49ca6f50867f705f6179e833",
      "required_labels": [
        "Calls",
        "Wallace Boden",
        "Ambulance 61"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "06",
      "sentence_id": "06-01",
      "text": "Open the training call and check its identity in Call Details.",
      "capture_id": "062-post-spinner-own-call-details",
      "image_sha256": "c3d4f8795ec461362479e194403b70c26932d53609cec42eedca6572db4fa5a2",
      "required_labels": [
        "Call Details"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "06",
      "sentence_id": "06-02",
      "text": "This saved exercise has a department call number ending in eight, and its Info view retains Routine, Investigation and the original note.",
      "capture_id": "062-post-spinner-own-call-details",
      "image_sha256": "c3d4f8795ec461362479e194403b70c26932d53609cec42eedca6572db4fa5a2",
      "required_labels": [
        "Info",
        "Routine",
        "Investigation",
        "Note"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "06",
      "sentence_id": "06-03",
      "text": "Choose Set Active for the incident you intend to work.",
      "capture_id": "062-post-spinner-own-call-details",
      "image_sha256": "c3d4f8795ec461362479e194403b70c26932d53609cec42eedca6572db4fa5a2",
      "required_labels": [
        "Set Active"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "06",
      "sentence_id": "06-04",
      "text": "The app reports Call set as active and opens Select Status.",
      "capture_id": "063-post-spinner-set-active-actual-sheet",
      "image_sha256": "c431558aba8c12a4af009e06b811c8b890460e86e0c8ed6b6d6220c84d586f41",
      "required_labels": [
        "Call set as active",
        "Select Status"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "07",
      "sentence_id": "07-01",
      "text": "Select Status is the first of three steps.",
      "capture_id": "064-responding-selected-unsubmitted",
      "image_sha256": "c9d08f5c27476c036ebf9f28279586185f640eb29975b3b3a36c01ff948a28ba",
      "required_labels": [
        "Select Status",
        "Step 1 of 3"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "07",
      "sentence_id": "07-02",
      "text": "The configured choices include Responding, Available, Committed, On Scene, Staging, Returning and Out of Service.",
      "capture_id": "064-responding-selected-unsubmitted",
      "image_sha256": "c9d08f5c27476c036ebf9f28279586185f640eb29975b3b3a36c01ff948a28ba",
      "required_labels": [
        "Responding",
        "Available",
        "Committed",
        "On Scene",
        "Staging",
        "Returning",
        "Out of Service"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "07",
      "sentence_id": "07-03",
      "text": "Here, Responding is selected; use Next to review its destination.",
      "capture_id": "064-responding-selected-unsubmitted",
      "image_sha256": "c9d08f5c27476c036ebf9f28279586185f640eb29975b3b3a36c01ff948a28ba",
      "required_labels": [
        "Responding",
        "Next"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "08",
      "sentence_id": "08-01",
      "text": "Select Destination for Responding distinguishes Calls, Stations and POIs from No Destination.",
      "capture_id": "065-owned-responding-select-destination",
      "image_sha256": "d6971a86553487974df9e74b3bf399e09fec08c248589a134318575510bcd64d",
      "required_labels": [
        "Select Destination for Responding",
        "Calls",
        "Stations",
        "POIs",
        "No Destination"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "08",
      "sentence_id": "08-02",
      "text": "The selected row is our new training incident, ending in eight.",
      "capture_id": "065-owned-responding-select-destination",
      "image_sha256": "d6971a86553487974df9e74b3bf399e09fec08c248589a134318575510bcd64d",
      "required_labels": [
        "FD51-2026-0008 - TRAINING ONLY - Native Unit response and deselection"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "08",
      "sentence_id": "08-03",
      "text": "Check that identity before using Next, so the status update is associated with the intended call.",
      "capture_id": "065-owned-responding-select-destination",
      "image_sha256": "d6971a86553487974df9e74b3bf399e09fec08c248589a134318575510bcd64d",
      "required_labels": [
        "Next"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "09",
      "sentence_id": "09-01",
      "text": "Add Note shows the selected Responding status and the training call together.",
      "capture_id": "068-own-responding-note-exact-prepared",
      "image_sha256": "94c9fb94dbf26b22c4b20bd38599fa442364685a283dbfbe2df779912156f923",
      "required_labels": [
        "Add Note"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "09",
      "sentence_id": "09-02",
      "text": "The optional note makes clear that this is a software exercise.",
      "capture_id": "068-own-responding-note-exact-prepared",
      "image_sha256": "94c9fb94dbf26b22c4b20bd38599fa442364685a283dbfbe2df779912156f923",
      "required_labels": [
        "Note (optional):"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "09",
      "sentence_id": "09-03",
      "text": "Review the summary, then use Submit to save the update.",
      "capture_id": "068-own-responding-note-exact-prepared",
      "image_sha256": "94c9fb94dbf26b22c4b20bd38599fa442364685a283dbfbe2df779912156f923",
      "required_labels": [
        "Submit"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "09",
      "sentence_id": "09-04",
      "text": "Status saved successfully is the returned result from that submission.",
      "capture_id": "069-own-responding-status-submit-result",
      "image_sha256": "609b1a93f6d0e346168f53562e1c9ac4b8c8a76ef268d77e0c6f3c6b17ef6977",
      "required_labels": [
        "Status saved successfully!"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "10",
      "sentence_id": "10-01",
      "text": "Back in Calls, the sidebar now shows Responding and the selected training call.",
      "capture_id": "070-own-call-active-after-status-save",
      "image_sha256": "0c984114147637a8b81e96f57a546a09e0a65a573099c3a1de08499755d131e9",
      "required_labels": [
        "Calls",
        "Responding",
        "#FD51-2026-0008"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "10",
      "sentence_id": "10-02",
      "text": "Keep the unit identity, its status and the active call in view when changing tasks.",
      "capture_id": "070-own-call-active-after-status-save",
      "image_sha256": "0c984114147637a8b81e96f57a546a09e0a65a573099c3a1de08499755d131e9",
      "required_labels": [
        "Ambulance 61",
        "Responding"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "10",
      "sentence_id": "10-03",
      "text": "The circle with an X below the active-call card is the Deselect control.",
      "capture_id": "070-own-call-active-after-status-save",
      "image_sha256": "0c984114147637a8b81e96f57a546a09e0a65a573099c3a1de08499755d131e9",
      "required_labels": [],
      "native_control": "Deselect",
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "11",
      "sentence_id": "11-01",
      "text": "Deselect Active Call asks whether to deselect the current active call.",
      "capture_id": "071-own-call-native-deselect-confirmation",
      "image_sha256": "534a572d188c18142e02e7677c427fc505a79d241923ce7e9fee1c485cad0299",
      "required_labels": [
        "Deselect Active Call",
        "Are you sure you want to deselect the current active call?"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "11",
      "sentence_id": "11-02",
      "text": "Use Cancel to keep the selection or Confirm to clear it.",
      "capture_id": "071-own-call-native-deselect-confirmation",
      "image_sha256": "534a572d188c18142e02e7677c427fc505a79d241923ce7e9fee1c485cad0299",
      "required_labels": [
        "Cancel",
        "Confirm"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "11",
      "sentence_id": "11-03",
      "text": "After Confirm, the sidebar reads No Active Call, while the incident remains in Calls and the unit still reads Responding.",
      "capture_id": "072-native-deselected-own-call-still-open",
      "image_sha256": "62b637c70483ac5375b53bf1a9a9e00c6c934543b1b9541ba5aea1669d4cc321",
      "required_labels": [
        "No Active Call",
        "Calls",
        "Responding"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "11",
      "sentence_id": "11-04",
      "text": "Clearing your active selection and closing the department incident are separate operations.",
      "capture_id": "072-native-deselected-own-call-still-open",
      "image_sha256": "62b637c70483ac5375b53bf1a9a9e00c6c934543b1b9541ba5aea1669d4cc321",
      "required_labels": [
        "No Active Call",
        "#FD51-2026-0008"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "12",
      "sentence_id": "12-01",
      "text": "Reopen the same training incident from Calls and confirm its title in Call Details.",
      "capture_id": "073-own-call-details-after-deselect",
      "image_sha256": "e720f861e0286358c0ce5ad99d2e0185bcaea4d244aca83336e4c156b5f2b849",
      "required_labels": [
        "Call Details"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "12",
      "sentence_id": "12-02",
      "text": "The three-dot menu at the upper right opens the available incident actions.",
      "capture_id": "073-own-call-details-after-deselect",
      "image_sha256": "e720f861e0286358c0ce5ad99d2e0185bcaea4d244aca83336e4c156b5f2b849",
      "required_labels": [],
      "native_control": "kebab-menu-button",
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "12",
      "sentence_id": "12-03",
      "text": "Edit Call and Close Call are separate choices.",
      "capture_id": "074-own-call-native-actions",
      "image_sha256": "43ba13cd32d6b340b4bb76fca2e0de3229eed7f5cc9a90b57c8b6c3cbe204224",
      "required_labels": [
        "Edit Call",
        "Close Call"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "12",
      "sentence_id": "12-04",
      "text": "Choose Close Call only when you have the authority and the incident is ready for closeout.",
      "capture_id": "074-own-call-native-actions",
      "image_sha256": "43ba13cd32d6b340b4bb76fca2e0de3229eed7f5cc9a90b57c8b6c3cbe204224",
      "required_labels": [
        "Close Call"
      ],
      "native_control": null,
      "speech_timing": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "13",
      "sentence_id": "13-01",
      "text": "The Close Call sheet requires a Close Type and provides a Close Note.",
      "capture_id": "075-own-call-close-form-defaults",
